Subject: Select original camera core with native ownership and checked lifecycle

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Separate stack, transitions and pose evaluation from the camera factory, asset
loader and impostor/gameplay services. Keep native camera allocations paired
with game frees, bound stack operations, and reject recursive mutation during
callbacks. Preserve original transition interpolation and timing order.

